GasPaymentHub
└── when the hub hot paths run on fresh state
    ├── given a first payment on a local lane
    │   └── it pays and the gas lands in the snapshot
    ├── given a first payment on a cross chain lane
    │   └── it pays and the gas lands in the snapshot
    ├── given a pending local payment
    │   └── it settles and the gas lands in the snapshot
    ├── given a pending cross chain payment
    │   └── it dispatches and the gas lands in the snapshot
    ├── given an expired pending payment
    │   └── it refunds and the gas lands in the snapshot
    └── given a credited merchant
        └── it withdraws and the gas lands in the snapshot
